    <string name="about_project_title">The project</string>
    <string name="about_project_text">Dragon Fury is the Android port of DBZ Budokai 3 HD Collection, a static recompilation of the Xbox 360 game: the game code runs natively, it is not emulated. Based on the PC project by NovaPowers:</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Thanks to: NovaPowers (DBZ Budokai 3 HD Collection), the ReXGlue SDK team, SDL, libadrenotools (bylaws) and the Turnip/Mesa driver builders (Mr. Purple, StevenMXZ, K11MCH1).</string>
    <string name="about_legal">Unofficial, non-commercial fan project. No game files are included: you need your own legal copy. Dragon Ball belongs to Bird Studio/Shueisha, Toei Animation and Bandai Namco.</string>
