    <string name="settings_direct_resolve_fast">Effects shortcut: fast mode</string>
    <string name="settings_direct_resolve_fast_sub">Also skips copying the effects into the game memory (only the texture is filled). Faster; turn it off if some effect looks wrong.</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_title">Turnip fixes (Adreno 6xx)</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_sub">For graphical glitches with Turnip on Adreno 6xx (e.g. 650). Applied when the game reopens; combine freely. The system driver ignores the TU_DEBUG ones.</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_sysmem">No GMEM (TU_DEBUG=sysmem)</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_nolrz">No LRZ and UBWC</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_paths">No dynamic rendering and stencil export</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_sync">Diagnostic: full sync (slow)</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_single_buffer">Game memory in one block (512 MB) — automatic on Turnip</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_bc">Decompressed BC textures</string>
    <string name="turnip_compat_depth">Depth as float 32</string>
    <string name="ingame_capture">Capture 2 frames (diagnostic)</string>
    <string name="settings_rt_direct">Direct render targets</string>
    <string name="settings_rt_direct_sub">Each pass draws into its own image with no copies between them (less GPU work). Turn off if parts of the image go missing.</string>
    <string name="settings_spec_shaders">Specialized shaders</string>
    <string name="settings_spec_shaders_sub">Each shader is compiled for the format of its textures, without the extra per-pixel branches and sampling (much faster texturing). Turn off if colors or textures look wrong.</string>
    <string name="tab_performance">Performance</string>
    <string name="tab_controls">Controls</string>
    <string name="perf_frameskip">30 FPS mode (frameskip)</string>
    <string name="perf_frameskip_sub">The game keeps running at normal speed, but only one of every two frames is drawn: about half the GPU work. Recommended for Mali GPUs.</string>
    <string name="perf_resolution_sub">The game renders at this resolution: 720p × 1-3, or below 720p (540p, 360p) for weak GPUs. 1080p is not offered (it would need a 1.5x scale).</string>
    <string name="perf_resolution_mem">2x and 3x need much more GPU memory. On Mali GPUs keep 1x.</string>
    <string name="perf_effects_title">Game effects</string>
    <string name="perf_effects_sub">Turning them off helps weak GPUs (such as Mali).</string>
    <string name="fx_bloom">Bloom (glow)</string>
    <string name="fx_bloom_sub">The glow around bright areas.</string>
    <string name="fx_dof">Depth of field</string>
    <string name="fx_dof_sub">The background blur.</string>
    <string name="fx_fxaa">Game FXAA</string>
    <string name="fx_fxaa_sub">The game\'s own edge smoothing (separate from the post anti-aliasing in Image).</string>
    <string name="fx_needs_rt_direct">These switches need \"Direct render targets\" turned on (GPU optimizations, below).</string>
    <string name="perf_gpu_title">GPU optimizations</string>
    <string name="perf_gpu_sub">Leave them on unless something looks wrong.</string>
    <string name="gpu_notice_title">Before you play</string>
    <string name="gpu_notice_text">The game was optimized on Qualcomm\'s own driver: Snapdragon 865 and newer run it with the system driver.\n\nThe Turnip driver also works well now, thanks to the new renderer. It is optional, in the Drivers tab.\n\nMali GPUs (e.g. Mali-G57) run it, but slower: turn on 30 FPS mode and turn off the game effects in the Performance tab.</string>
